Source: matugen
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ackerman-00 <quietcraft@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cargo, rustc
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/InioX/matugen

Package: matugen
Architecture: any
# Compiled Rust binary, fully vendored: shlibdeps resolves the linked
# system libs (libc only, in practice).
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Material You color generation tool
 Matugen is a Material You color generation tool that supports templates.
